# StocksHub API Rules

## Project
A-share market dashboard with real-time data API.

## API Base
http://localhost (local proxy)

## Key Endpoints

### Market Data
- GET /api/quote/{code} - Real-time quote (price, change, volume)
- GET /api/search?q={query} - Search stocks by name/code/pinyin
- GET /api/detail/{code} - Stock fundamentals (PE, PB, market cap)
- GET /api/kline/{code} - K-line OHLCV data

### Market Overview
- GET /api/market-stats - Advance/decline counts, limit up/down
- GET /api/market-sentiment - Sentiment score (0-100)
- GET /api/market-leaders - Top gainers, losers, volume
- GET /api/hot-sectors - Hot industries and concepts

### Analysis
- GET /api/strategies - List scan strategies
- GET /api/strategy/{name} - Run strategy scan
- GET /api/research/{code} - Stock research reports
- GET /api/market-analysis - AI market analysis

## Index Codes
- sh000001 - 上证指数
- 399001 - 深证成指
- 399006 - 创业板指

## Usage
Always use http://localhost as base URL.
Rate limit: ~10 req/s, cache 30s for quotes.
